":"ごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと完璧に出来るように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"練習に励みます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今度じゃなくて今出来るように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ならないとダメなのに(´･_･`)。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東日本復興のために開いたこの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンサートですがとまとが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言っていたように1年たった今でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"助けを求めている人がいる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということを忘れないでほしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はそのためのコンサートです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルになって前のあたしよりは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きな力になれたけど東北の人の心"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を元気づけるためにはまだまだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足りません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北の方に会いに行きたいよ(´･ω･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は募金を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方がしていただいた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らしくそれをメンバーから聞いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのその暖かい気持ちが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても大好きです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔と元気は絶やさないぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北の方も元気に笑顔に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安心出来る日が一刻も早く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/9677130/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}